{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This demo includes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grid-based combat with front and back row mechanics, encouraging smart positioning and strategic planning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A <strong>Damage Bar</strong> mechanic that replaces RNG for a more skill-based experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Branching path choices leading to distinct encounters, enemy types, and rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A combat rewards system that grants buffs and debuffs, providing a critical edge\u2014or disadvantage\u2014based on performance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A preview of the <strong>permadeath mechanic</strong>, where fallen units are lost permanently across the mission chain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Access to four of Unit 7 classes\u2014<strong>Ranger, Specialist, Sniper\u00a0</strong>and <strong>Grenadier</strong>\u2014each with a unique role and specialized combat abilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Languages Supported</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">English</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Japanese</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Portuguese \u2013 Brazil</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">French</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">German</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spanish \u2013 Spain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simplified Chinese</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traditional Chinese</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Russian</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Player Modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Single Player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keyboard &amp; Mouse</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3730350?t=1747770172","ba